- The Asia/Taipei Unique ID fixture passed. Bounded fuzz smoke passed (121 frame seeds, 11 message seeds, 2,112 mutations, 170 frame decodes, 109 message decodes). Offline deterministic race/leak smoke passed 16 cases × 3.
- Release facade examples built. The offline benchmark compiled and ran on Apple M5 Max (18 logical CPUs), macOS ARM64, Rust 1.85.0. Observations (ns/iteration; allocation calls and allocated bytes per iteration): frame encode/decode 2,467.3 (40 / 4,676); Zstd record decode 1,740.3 (17 / 197,493); Producer request construction 2,003.7 (54 / 3,665); 128-entry route lookup 26.8 (0 / 0); loopback pending completion 58,156.2 (81 / 9,546). Fixed iteration/input sizes are emitted by the benchmark itself; these are observations, not thresholds.
