- Windows `x86_64-pc-windows-gnu` cross-check passed for the full workspace, all targets and all features. The attempted MSVC cross-check could not run on this host because the 1.85.0 MSVC target standard library/SDK is unavailable to the macOS C build toolchain; native Windows execution and current-revision GitHub CI were not run, and no push was made.
